# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# AUTO JOB APPLIER — Environment Configuration
# cp .env.example .env  then edit the values you need
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ─── AI Mode ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
#   auto   → try Gemini, fallback OpenAI, fallback local  (DEFAULT)
#   local  → built-in keyword matcher, NO API calls at all
#   gemini → Gemini only (requires GEMINI_API_KEY)
#   openai → OpenAI only (requires OPENAI_API_KEY)
#
AI_MODE=auto

# ─── AI API Keys (leave blank to run in local/offline mode) ──────────────────
GEMINI_API_KEY=
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# ─── Optional: Supabase (SQLite used automatically if not set) ────────────────
SUPABASE_URL=sb_publishable_yJDGNz0qhrNG2rTFG09cZQ_b9OGMGju
SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY=

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://oqaqljyehhveyhtnxitj.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_xAPTmgVd3hWneRa9gtVKSg_zTz1fdCV

# ─── Backend ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
PORT=4000
NODE_ENV=production
LOG_LEVEL=info
FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:3000
DATA_DIR=/app/data

# ─── Frontend ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# URL the browser uses to reach the backend API.
# Docker local: keep http://localhost:4000
# Remote server: set to https://your-domain.com:4000
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4000
